# Desktop application catalog, read by BOTH halves of the desktop:
#   zview  (the window server) reads name/execpath/multi for its right-click
#          launcher menu -- the fallback launcher that works even with no dock;
#   zdock  (the dock, the desktop's separate "shell") reads every field and
#          draws one icon per entry in its bar along the top of the screen.
# One line per app:  name:execpath:multi:icon:X,Y   (the last two optional)
#   name        menu label, dock-icon label, AND the app's title base: by
#               convention it equals the title the program declares in its
#               HRAPP, which is how the dock (and the menu's single-instance
#               re-raise) match windows to this entry.
#   execpath    program; run with a bare argv (plus -P X,Y from the dock)
#   multi       1 = may open many copies (dock: middle click starts another;
#               menu shows "New <name>...");
#               0 = single instance (a second launch raises it instead)
#   icon        .icn under /usr/hr/icons, shown in the dock.  EVERY entry's
#               icon is always visible there: sitting high with the name
#               beneath while nothing runs, pressed (dropped down, no name)
#               while the app has a window or a launch is in flight.  Left
#               click launches or switches to the app's topmost window.
#   X,Y         where a dock launch puts the window (top-left of the frame);
#               left out, the server places it.  Keep Y clear of the dock
#               strip (the top ~70px) or the new window opens under it.
#
# The window itself -- title, size, icon while hidden, whether it may be
# stretched -- is NOT configured here: the application declares it at
# start-up (hr_open, see inc/hrapp.h), so a program can also be run straight
# from a shell.
#
# The rc script /usr/hr/etc/rc runs at desktop start-up: it starts the dock,
# and anything else that should be genuinely RESIDENT from power-on.
Shell:/usr/hr/bin/zterm:1:term.icn:48,88
Files:/usr/hr/bin/zfile:1:file.icn:120,100
Editor:/usr/hr/bin/zedit:1:edit.icn:80,84
Mail:/usr/hr/bin/zmail:0:mail.icn:100,120
Manual:/usr/hr/bin/zman:0:man.icn:180,140
Calculator:/usr/hr/bin/zcalc:0:calc.icn:600,180
Printer:/usr/hr/bin/zprint:0:printer.icn:380,300
Monitor:/usr/hr/bin/zmon:0:monitor.icn:300,180
Puzzle:/usr/hr/bin/zpuzzle:0:puzzle.icn:700,300
Maze:/usr/hr/bin/zmaze:0:maze.icn:620,300
Clock:/usr/hr/bin/zclock:0:clock.icn:720,88
